# sweep: --seed-root scripts/fixtures/sudoku/unreadable-save
# A save the app cannot read is kept and explained, never silently replaced.
wait-for Cannot open game
expect Your saved game has been kept.
expect Try again
expect-missing Sudoku · Easy 1
clean
shot sudoku-unreadable
tap Try again
wait-for Cannot open game
expect-missing Sudoku · Easy 1
# Start over is the way past it: it asks first, keeps a copy of the
# unreadable game, and the fresh game is what a restart finds.
expect Start over
tap Start over
wait-for Start over?
expect Your saved game stays on the Kobo as a separate copy
clean
shot sudoku-unreadable-start-over
tap Go back
wait-for Cannot open game
tap Start over
wait-for Start over?
tap-id confirm-start-over
wait-for Sudoku · Easy 1
expect 53 left
restart
wait-for Sudoku · Easy 1
expect-missing Cannot open game
